@functionHost = http://localhost:7071
@functionKey = REPLACE-WITH-YOUR-FUNCTION-KEY

POST {{functionHost}}/api/CopyProyectFromTemplate?code={{functionKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sourceProjectId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
  "targetProjectId": "22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222"
}

###

### Copy a project into ANOTHER environment (new project, new ids). The source is the
### environment that holds sourceProjectId; no targetProjectId is sent.
POST {{functionHost}}/api/CopyProyectFromTemplate?code={{functionKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sourceProjectId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
  "environmentUrl": "https://source.crm.dynamics.com",
  "environmentApiUrl": "https://source.api.crm.dynamics.com",
  "cloud": "Commercial",
  "targetEnvironment": {
    "name": "UAT",
    "environmentUrl": "https://uat.crm.dynamics.com",
    "environmentApiUrl": "https://uat.api.crm.dynamics.com",
    "cloud": "Commercial"
  }
}

###

### Destination environments offered to the PCF
GET {{functionHost}}/api/Environments?code={{functionKey}}
